custom `CacheClass` to override that signature, but to no avail.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2641048347/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648775226","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102491#issuecomment-2648775226","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102491","id":2648775226,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d4Ro6","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T17:37:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T17:37:16Z","body":"> edit: I just learned that SCons actually check for the compiler binary, if there's any changes. But as `emcc` is a wrapper (emcc is just an executable ~python file~ bash file that calls a python script with the rest of the arguments), it may still have the same checksum as a previous version, hence breaking SCons detection system.\r\n\r\nJust to make sure that everyone is on the same page: this shouldn't affect cache for standard compilers (in which the compiler binary changes every version), except for the first build after this patch.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, I talked with some people of the SCons team (on their nice Discord server!) about this issue and we weren't able to find a specific solution about the issue of compilers not changing their signature between versions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648775226/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649260005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102491#issuecomment-2649260005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102491","id":2649260005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d6H_l","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T21:16:54Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T21:16:54Z","body":"Closing as superseded by #102676.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649260005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]